# ============================================================================
# CHAOS REDUX - EVENT 013 ABNORMAL DISASTER PATH MAP
# ============================================================================
# Layout follows the regions painted into GFX_013_abnormal_disaster_panel
# (760x520 drawn at scale 1.43, 1087x744 window):
#   header plate     x 148-938, y 18-62   title, family icon, sequence status
#   segment column   x 40-182,  y 102-582 five painted slots, one per card
#   path canvas      x 230-765, y 94-612  path art, markers, notes, view controls
#   detail panel     x 798-1062, y 94-613 selected segment
#   legend tray      x 56-583,  y 640-725 legend title and cell bar
#   severity strip   x 638-1044, y 640-725 nine painted swatches, five stops
# Buttons that carry text are never scaled: the engine centres button text on
# the unscaled sprite frame. Text-free click regions use transparent hitboxes
# drawn after the art and labels they cover.
# ============================================================================

